3,&H000000FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,2,0,8,10,10,80,1Style: OP13-Karaoke,Duality,60,&H00E24B33,&H000000FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3,0,8,10,10,10,1Style: OP13-Translation,Duality,60,&H00E24B33,&H000000FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3,0,2,10,10,10,1Style: OP13-Kanji,Duality,60,&H00E24B33,&H000000FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3,0,8,10,10,110,1Style: OP13-Credits,FOT-Greco Std B,40,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00000000,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,95,100,1,0,1,2.2,0,1,80,10,100,1Style: Pekoms - Infobox,Roboto,39,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00000000,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,2,2,2,10,10,10,1Style: Map,Roboto,39,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00000000,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,2,2,2,10,10,10,1[Events]Format: Layer, Start, End, Style, Name, MarginL, MarginR, MarginV, Effect, Text﻿[Script Info]; Script generated by Aegisub 3.2.2; http://www.aegisub.org/Title: Default Aegisub fileScriptType: v4.00+WrapStyle: 0ScaledBorderAndShadow: yesYCbCr Matrix: NonePlayResX: 1280PlayResY: 720Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.05,0:01:53.38,Title,,0,0,250,,The Girl They Called a DevilDialogue: 0,0:01:53.74,0:01:56.26,Main,,0,0,0,,They've come all this way after braving the Aqua Laguna.Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.26,0:01:59.16,Main,,0,0,0,,It's pretty incredible, honestly.Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.16,0:02:00.94,Main,,0,0,0,,They seem to have some good luck.Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.94,0:02:03.39,Main,,0,0,0,,This time we have permission to kill them.Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.39,0:02:06.56,Main,,0,0,0,,It'll be easy since we don't have to go easy on them.Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.56,0:02:08.08,Main,,0,0,0,,The drawbridge?Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.08,0:02:11.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah. The Franky Family is currently fighting to bring it down.Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.57,0:02:16.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Once it comes down, we can go over to the other side.Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.22,0:02:19.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Geez... when it's right in front of us...Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.07,0:02:31.21,Main,,0,0,0,,You idiot...Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.21,0:02:36.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Honestly, just how heavy is the burden she carries?Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.75,0:02:40.07,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, CP9! Listen up!Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.07,0:02:44.02,Main,,0,0,0,,You have my permission to kill them, but take them on here at the Tower of Justice!Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.14,0:02:48.97,Main,,0,0,0,,The most important things of all are my life and promotion.Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.97,0:02:56.31,Main,,0,0,0,,If I let them loose, who’ll protect me if something happens?!Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.35,0:03:00.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Stupid pirates!Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.34,0:03:06.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Recognize that your brave front doesn't change anything!Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.26,0:03:10.85,Main,,0,0,0,,You’re up against the power of CP9’s assassins...Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.85,0:03:15.99,Main,,0,0,0,,and the heft of the Gates of Justice, which no one can open!Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.99,0:03:18.89,Main,,0,0,0,,And more importantly...Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.89,0:03:21.96,Main,,0,0,0,,I have the authority to use this Golden Transponder Snail...Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.96,0:03:25.56,Main,,0,0,0,,to exercise a Buster Call!Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.26,0:03:27.98,Main,,0,0,0,,A Buster Call...!Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.98,0:03:29.84,Main,,0,0,0,,That's right.Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.84,0:03:32.62,Main,,0,0,0,,It's the power that wiped out your homeland...Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.62,0:03:37.54,Main,,0,0,0,,exactly twenty years ago, Nico Robin.Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.54,0:03:42.91,Main,,0,0,0,,I remember that the following year, the name "Ohara" had been wiped off of the map.Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.91,0:03:45.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Robin's homeland?Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.00,0:03:47.50,Main,,0,0,0,,That damn masked jerk!Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.00,0:03:51.90,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I have nowhere to go and no place to call home.Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.40,0:03:54.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't!Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.67,0:03:56.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Not that!Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.81,0:04:00.65,Main,,0,0,0,,That's a nice reaction. It gives me a thrill.Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.65,0:04:04.66,Main,,0,0,0,,What? Does that mean you want me to press this button...Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.66,0:04:08.84,Main,,0,0,0,,to call in a Buster Call? Hm? Does it?Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.84,0:04:13.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Do you really understand what'll happen when you press it?Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.91,0:04:20.84,Main,,0,0,0,,I do. It'll eliminate the possibility of the pirates escaping from this island!Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.84,0:04:23.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Just with this single button.Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.29,0:04:25.30,Main,,0,0,0,,It's that simple.Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.30,0:04:27.62,Main,,0,0,0,,It won't be that simple!Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.62,0:04:31.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you remembering something?Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.39,0:04:34.82,Main,,0,0,0,,If you like, shall I try pressing it?Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.82,0:04:37.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Right here, right now?Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.10,0:04:43.27,Main,,0,0,0,,What're you doing?! Stop it!Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.67,0:04:48.83,Main,,0,0,0,,You sure have a cocky mouth on you!Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.78,0:05:09.56,Main,,0,0,0,,You said that Ohara had been wiped off the map.Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.56,0:05:13.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Can you see humans on a map?!Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.10,0:05:16.94,Main,,0,0,0,,It's because you guys see the world that way...Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.94,0:05:20.31,Main,,0,0,0,,that you can do such a cruel thing!Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.30,0:05:33.99,Main,,0,0,0,,The Buster Call is a merciless power that disregards all goals!Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.99,0:05:37.16,Main,,0,0,0,,You mustn't use it. Not that.Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.16,0:05:40.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Never...! Not that!Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.15,0:05:50.04,Captions,,0,0,0,,20 years ago – West Blue OharaDialogue: 0,0:05:52.64,0:05:53.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Robin's over here!Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.94,0:05:55.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Get her!Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.79,0:05:58.26,Captions,,0,0,0,,Nico Robin 8 Years OldDialogue: 0,0:05:57.26,0:05:58.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Ow!Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.81,0:06:00.75,Main,,0,0,0,,All right!Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.75,0:06:02.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, monster!Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.35,0:06:04.70,Main,,0,0,0,,You're creepy!Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.70,0:06:10.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Monster! Monster! Monster! Monster!Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.61,0:06:17.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Ahh! The monster hit me!Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.46,0:06:19.73,Main,,0,0,0,,She's creepy!Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.73,0:06:21.41,Main,,0,0,0,,We'll get you for this!Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.89,0:06:47.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, you!Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.68,0:06:55.44,Main,,0,0,0,,My children came home crying, saying that you hit them for no reason.Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.44,0:06:58.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Stay away from my children.Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.22,0:07:00.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Why don't you say something?!Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.44,0:07:04.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Geez... You really are a creepy child.Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.26,0:07:08.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait!Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.05,0:07:10.01,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm not done with you yet!Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.77,0:07:21.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Mommy, Mommy, what're we having for dinner tonight?Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.44,0:07:22.65,Main,,0,0,0,,What'd you like to eat?Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.65,0:07:24.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Um... Um...Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.76,0:07:26.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Rice omelet!Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.27,0:07:29.35,Main,,0,0,0,,You sure like rice omelets!Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.35,0:07:32.79,Main,,0,0,0,,– Yep! – We have to buy lots of eggs, then.Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.79,0:07:34.11,Main,,0,0,0,,All right!Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.72,0:07:46.59,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm back. I'm sorry I'm late.Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.52,0:07:48.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Aunt Roji?Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.57,0:08:01.96,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,"To Robin. Today is..."Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.96,0:08:04.07,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,our daughter's birthday.Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.07,0:08:09.08,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,So we decided that the three of us would go out for dinner as a family.Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.08,0:08:13.19,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,There's some bread, so just have that for dinner.Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.12,0:08:17.11,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Don't use too much jam.Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.11,0:08:23.43,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,After dinner, before we get home, do the dishes, clean the house,Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.43,0:08:28.49,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,and take the laundry in, then go upstairs early.Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.90,0:08:38.61,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Mommy, Mommy, what're we having for dinner tonight?Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.61,0:08:40.62,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,What'd you like to eat?Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.62,0:08:42.98,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Um... Um...Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.98,0:08:44.86,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Rice omelet!Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.56,0:08:47.58,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,You sure like rice omelets, don't you?Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.58,0:08:50.68,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,– Yep! – We have to buy lots of eggs, then.Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.68,0:08:51.87,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,All right!Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.13,0:09:12.06,Captions,,0,0,0,,The Tree of Knowledge Ohara Library and Archaeological Research CenterDialogue: 0,0:09:12.06,0:09:15.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh! There she is! Robin's here!Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.14,0:09:16.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Looks like she came to return a book.Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.91,0:09:18.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Everyone, to your positions.Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.56,0:09:27.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Good evening, Professor Clover! I came to return the book I borrowed.Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.94,0:09:33.83,Main,,0,0,0,,One, two...!Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.83,0:09:37.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Congratulations, Robin!Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.91,0:09:37.55,Captions,,0,0,0,,Archaeologists of OharaDialogue: 0,0:09:37.55,0:09:40.64,Main,,0,0,0,,– You're amazing, Robin! – Just as we'd expect from a genius!Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.64,0:09:42.94,Main,,0,0,0,,We've got a cake for you!Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.94,0:09:46.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Robin, the exam for the doctoral degree you took the other day...Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.63,0:09:48.57,Main,,0,0,0,,You quite amazingly got 100% on it!Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.57,0:09:52.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Hence, from today on, we acknowledge you as an archaeologist.Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.66,0:09:58.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Now you're one of us and we'll do research together.Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.92,0:10:03.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Here, this proves that you're a scholar. Take this, Robin.Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.32,0:10:05.27,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm happy for you, Robin.Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.27,0:10:06.85,Main,,0,0,0,,Congratulations!Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.50,0:10:13.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Listen, Robin. You must understand well what it means to be an archaeologist.Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.55,0:10:13.70,Captions,,0,0,0,,Professor Clover Ohara Library's Head Librarian (Authority on Archaeology)Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.70,0:10:16.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, Professor Clover!Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.20,0:10:20.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Knowledge comes from the past.Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.43,0:10:25.38,Main,,0,0,0,,This Tree of Knowledge is 5000 years old.Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.38,0:10:27.64,Main,,0,0,0,,For centuries, people have brought...Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.64,0:10:30.44,Main,,0,0,0,, massive amounts of books to this tree from the world over.Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.44,0:10:35.57,Main,,0,0,0,,It's an irreplaceable treasure for all humanity.Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.57,0:10:39.86,Main,,0,0,0,,This is the world's largest, oldest library and a glorious store of knowledge.Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.86,0:10:42.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Eminent archaeologists from across the seas...Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.92,0:10:45.67,Main,,0,0,0,,come forward and gather under this Tree of Knowledge.Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.67,0:10:49.22,Main,,0,0,0,,There are no historical mysteries...Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.22,0:10:52.76,Main,,0,0,0,,we cannot unlock using these books.Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.26,0:10:54.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Got that, Robin?Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.97,0:10:56.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes!Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.71,0:11:03.24,Main,,0,0,0,,I'd like to see you contribute to the world by researching various cultures.Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.24,0:11:08.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Professor! I'd like to solve the mystery of the gap in history!Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.06,0:11:12.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Wha... No! You shouldn't! I forbid you to do it, just as I always have.Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.86,0:11:16.67,Main,,0,0,0,,What? Why? If we research the Poneglyphs,Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.67,0:11:19.70,Main,,0,0,0,,we'll know what happened during the Void Century, right?Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.20,0:11:23.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Why do you know that much?Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.40,0:11:26.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Did you peek into the basement using your powers?!Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.96,0:11:28.16,Main,,0,0,0,,But...Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.16,0:11:33.13,Main,,0,0,0,,You should know that trying to decipher the Poneglyphs is a criminal act!Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.13,0:11:34.21,Main,,0,0,0,,What...?Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.21,0:11:36.68,Main,,0,0,0,,But...Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.68,0:11:38.77,Main,,0,0,0,,you guys have been researching the Poneglyphs...Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.77,0:11:41.56,Main,,0,0,0,,in the basement late at night!Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.56,0:11:45.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Robin! How come you know that?!Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.63,0:11:49.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Explain yourself! Are you saying that you've been spying on that, too?Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.90,0:11:53.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Answer me, Robin!Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.13,0:11:55.52,Main,,0,0,0,,But...Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.52,0:12:00.02,Main,,0,0,0,,if I just walked up, you wouldn't let me in!Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.50,0:12:08.25,Main,,0,0,0,,I thought... you'd let me be part of your research if I became an archaeologist.Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.25,0:12:10.90,Main,,0,0,0,,So I studied very hard!Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.69,0:12:14.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Robin...Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.55,0:12:22.85,Main,,0,0,0,,It's true that you've acquired enough knowledge to be called a scholar.Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.85,0:12:25.93,Main,,0,0,0,,But... you're still a child.Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.93,0:12:29.37,Main,,0,0,0,,If they find out what we're doing, our heads will roll.Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.37,0:12:32.57,Main,,0,0,0,,We're doing it fully aware of the risk.Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.57,0:12:36.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Ever since it became law 800 years ago,Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.70,0:12:41.37,Main,,0,0,0,,there actually have been numerous scholars who lost their lives.Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.37,0:12:44.54,Main,,0,0,0,,This is a good opportunity, so let me tell you this.Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.54,0:12:48.55,Main,,0,0,0,,The Ohara researchers are the only ones in history...Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.55,0:12:51.76,Main,,0,0,0,,who've managed to decipher the ancient texts.Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.76,0:12:55.21,Main,,0,0,0,,We cannot go back.Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.21,0:12:57.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Swear to the Tree of Knowledge!Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.52,0:12:59.95,Main,,0,0,0,,If you try to approach the basement again,Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.95,0:13:05.98,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll forbid you from entering the research lab and the library! Got that?Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.76,0:13:10.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Robin!Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.56,0:13:15.06,Main,,0,0,0,,She's following in her mother's footsteps in every way.Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.06,0:13:19.07,Main,,0,0,0,,She still doesn't know about the incident from the other day.Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.97,0:13:24.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Robin's mother, Olvia, has been captured.Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.04,0:13:27.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Her fate is already sealed.Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.98,0:13:31.82,Captions,,0,0,0,,The Following DayDialogue: 0,0:14:02.90,0:14:04.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Grrr!Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.94,0:14:19.70,Main,,0,0,0,,W... Wa...Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.94,0:14:23.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Worms?Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.98,0:14:34.53,Main,,0,0,0,,That hit the spot!Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.55,0:14:42.89,Captions,,0,0,0,,Saul (Giant) CastawayDialogue: 0,0:14:42.16,0:14:45.47,Main,,0,0,0,,I’m alive! Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.47,0:14:48.95,Main,,0,0,0,,I wonder if she's okay, too.Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.93,0:14:54.73,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm safe for now. Thanks.Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.73,0:14:57.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Is there a town or something on this island?Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.65,0:14:59.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah.Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.32,0:15:00.91,Main,,0,0,0,,I see.Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.48,0:15:07.68,Main,,0,0,0,,If I was going to drift to somewhere, I would've liked an uninhabited island.Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.99,0:15:18.86,Main,,0,0,0,,You can stay there if you want, but nothing's gonna happen.Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.86,0:15:24.53,Main,,0,0,0,,My leg got injured, so I'll stay put here.Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.53,0:15:29.95,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm planning to make a raft or something and leave here eventually.Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.87,0:15:33.82,Main,,0,0,0,,This your first time seeing a Giant?Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.82,0:15:34.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Yep.Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.91,0:15:40.75,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you, don't lump me in with those guys from Elbaf.Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.75,0:15:45.08,Main,,0,0,0,,There are peaceful Giant tribes, too.Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.08,0:15:46.97,Main,,0,0,0,,I see...Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.67,0:15:50.97,Main,,0,0,0,,I know it's a long shot, but I'll ask you anyway.Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.97,0:15:56.89,Main,,0,0,0,,When you get home, I don't want you to tell anyone about me.Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.89,0:15:58.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay.Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.46,0:16:03.15,Main,,0,0,0,,That was too easy. She'll definitely tell.Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.65,0:16:05.07,Main,,0,0,0,,I won't tell.Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.26,0:16:14.25,Main,,0,0,0,,That's a lie! There's no way that a child can keep a secret.Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.25,0:16:18.28,Main,,0,0,0,,I won't tell because I'm not interested in you.Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.81,0:16:36.47,Main,,0,0,0,,"Dereshi"?Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.47,0:16:37.77,Main,,0,0,0,,What does that mean?Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.27,0:16:41.63,Main,,0,0,0,,What does it mean? I'm just laughing.Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.74,0:16:45.44,Main,,0,0,0,,You're laughing?Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.44,0:16:48.25,Main,,0,0,0,,You're a funny girl.Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.49,0:16:54.98,Main,,0,0,0,,That's a weird way of laughing.Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.29,0:17:02.35,Main,,0,0,0,,I've always been told that I'm not good at laughing.Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.35,0:17:05.43,Main,,0,0,0,,You're cute when you laugh.Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.43,0:17:08.33,Main,,0,0,0,,– What? – You should laugh more.Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.35,0:17:15.81,Main,,0,0,0,,My name is Saul. Jaguar D. Saul.Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.41,0:17:17.81,Main,,0,0,0,,"D"?Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.81,0:17:24.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah. I don't know why, but everyone in my family has it in their names.Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.86,0:17:26.28,Main,,0,0,0,,What's your name?Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.28,0:17:27.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Robin.Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.55,0:17:33.22,Main,,0,0,0,,To tell you the truth, Robin, people are after me.Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.22,0:17:35.90,Main,,0,0,0,,So if people find me, I'll be in trouble.Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.90,0:17:37.07,Main,,0,0,0,,I said I wouldn't tell!Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.33,0:17:42.72,Captions,,0,0,0,,Three Days After the Giant Was Cast AshoreDialogue: 0,0:17:48.80,0:17:50.47,Main,,0,0,0,,That was delicious!Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.47,0:17:51.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Here's another one.Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.56,0:17:58.80,Main,,0,0,0,,I appreciate the thought, but you go ahead and eat it.Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.80,0:18:05.36,Main,,0,0,0,,I’m not hungry. I caught and ate some fish last night.Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.36,0:18:07.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay.Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.16,0:18:12.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, it'll be completed soon. I'll keep working on building a raft.Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.30,0:18:21.20,Main,,0,0,0,,In any case, you sure have lots of time on your hands, huh?Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.20,0:18:25.24,Main,,0,0,0,,You've been with me all day long for the past several days.Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.24,0:18:27.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Your friends and parents will get suspicious.Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.43,0:18:31.44,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't have parents.Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.44,0:18:33.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, I do have a mother,Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.29,0:18:36.32,Main,,0,0,0,,but she set sail for work when I was small and hasn't come back.Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.32,0:18:37.95,Main,,0,0,0,,So I don't even remember her face.Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.33,0:18:43.51,Main,,0,0,0,,I like those archaeologists, but they don't include me in their research,Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.51,0:18:45.45,Main,,0,0,0,,so I feel left out.Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.45,0:18:50.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Kids in town say that I'm creepy, so I won't play with them.Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.12,0:18:56.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, so you're a Devil Fruit user, huh?Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.25,0:18:58.71,Main,,0,0,0,,You aren't scared?Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.71,0:19:01.90,Main,,0,0,0,,I've traveled the Grand Line,Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.90,0:19:05.01,Main,,0,0,0,,so I've seen tons of powerful Devil Fruit users.Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.80,0:19:07.36,Main,,0,0,0,,I see...Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.36,0:19:09.02,Main,,0,0,0,,I envy you.Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.02,0:19:11.05,Main,,0,0,0,,That looks convenient!Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.64,0:19:20.36,Main,,0,0,0,,You really do laugh in a weird way.Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.93,0:19:24.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Weird or not...Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.12,0:19:25.73,Main,,0,0,0,,you know...Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.73,0:19:29.16,Main,,0,0,0,,if you laugh, it'll make you happy.Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.57,0:19:31.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Why?Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.00,0:19:34.88,Main,,0,0,0,,"Why?" When you're having fun, you laugh.Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.88,0:19:39.63,Main,,0,0,0,,So if you laugh, you'll have fun.Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.63,0:19:43.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Although you're only a child, you seem to be having a hard time.Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.61,0:19:47.76,Main,,0,0,0,,So laugh. When you're having a hard time, just laugh.Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.76,0:19:50.64,Main,,0,0,0,,It seems stupid to laugh when you're having a hard time.Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.64,0:19:52.62,Main,,0,0,0,,That's not true.Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.62,0:19:57.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Go ahead, give it a shot!Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.77,0:20:04.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Deresh.Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.46,0:20:08.54,Main,,0,0,0,,That's right! Do it like this!Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.39,0:20:18.27,Main,,0,0,0,,That's good! That's good!Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.34,0:20:25.28,Main,,0,0,0,,This is Navy Headquarters.Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.28,0:20:27.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Chief Spandine, please come in.Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.98,0:20:30.19,Main,,0,0,0,,They want to talk to you, Chief.Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.19,0:20:33.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Just ignore it. I'm sure they just want a status report.Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.40,0:20:36.94,Main,,0,0,0,,We'll contact them when we see the shore.Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.99,0:20:41.94,Captions,,0,0,0,,Spandine – CP9 Chief (20 years earlier)Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.94,0:20:39.92,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't care whether it's Ohara or Opera–Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.92,0:20:44.22,Main,,0,0,0,,why do I have to come all the way to the West Blue?Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.22,0:20:45.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Seriously...Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.91,0:20:48.62,Main,,0,0,0,,What a worthless mission...Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.69,0:20:54.44,Captions,,0,0,0,,The Following Day, Four Days After the Giant Drifted AshoreDialogue: 0,0:21:08.77,0:21:11.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, is it true that a Navy ship came?Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.50,0:21:13.31,Main,,0,0,0,,What? A Navy ship did?Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.31,0:21:15.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I heard that it was anchored here when day broke.Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.83,0:21:17.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Why would the Navy come...Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.87,0:21:19.65,Main,,0,0,0,,to such a remote island?Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.65,0:21:23.25,Main,,0,0,0,,But no one has seen any marines on it.Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.25,0:21:24.62,Main,,0,0,0,,What the heck?Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.62,0:21:28.27,Main,,0,0,0,,No one's on it. It's like a ghost ship.Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.27,0:21:30.38,Main,,0,0,0,,That's ridiculous.Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.98,0:21:34.33,Main,,0,0,0,,– Professor! – Professor Clover!Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.64,0:21:38.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Did something happen?Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.39,0:21:43.64,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it, but a Navy ship is anchored at the shore!Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.64,0:21:48.15,Main,,0,0,0,,It's likely an investigation. We should be cautious, just in case!Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.15,0:21:50.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Let the scholars know.Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.30,0:21:55.94,Main,,0,0,0,,The raft's done!Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.44,0:22:03.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Then... you're leaving already?Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.09,0:22:05.14,Main,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.14,0:22:09.40,Main,,0,0,0,,You've got "I'm lonely" written all over your face.Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.40,0:22:13.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, I was thinking of attaching a flag or something.Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.48,0:22:15.96,Main,,0,0,0,,So I'll stay here a little longer.Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.00,0:22:27.30,Main,,0,0,0,,To sea? So you wanna set out to sea, too?Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.30,0:22:28.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Yep.Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.90,0:22:33.27,Main,,0,0,0,,My mother has been busy with her archaeological research all this time.Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.27,0:22:36.61,Main,,0,0,0,,But when she comes back to this island next time,Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.61,0:22:39.56,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm going to ask her to take me with her to sea.Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.56,0:22:44.04,Main,,0,0,0,,So I studied hard and I was finally able to become an archaeologist.Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.04,0:22:48.41,Main,,0,0,0,,An archaeologist? When you're still so small?Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.41,0:22:49.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Yep.Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.74,0:22:55.88,Main,,0,0,0,,But... you don't even remember your mother's face, right?Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.88,0:22:58.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Right... but she's still my mother.Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.75,0:23:01.64,Main,,0,0,0,,I wanna see her.Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.84,0:23:05.59,Main,,0,0,0,,– Say, Saul... – Hm?Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.59,0:23:10.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Did you know that history has a big gap of 100 years that no one knows about?Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.59,0:23:14.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah. It's called the Void Century.Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.45,0:23:19.35,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm curious about it, but the Government prohibits people from investigating, so...Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.35,0:23:24.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah. I heard that my mother is traveling around the world investigating it.Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.36,0:23:28.83,Main,,0,0,0,,But don't tell anyone about it, since it's actually a crime.Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.83,0:23:29.70,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.70,0:23:35.59,Main,,0,0,0,,C-Could it mean that she's traveling in search of those stones called Poneglyphs?Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.29,0:23:38.21,Main,,0,0,0,,So you know about the Poneglyphs?Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.21,0:23:44.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Of course I do! But don't talk about it in front of people, okay?!Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.48,0:23:48.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Not to mention, about your mother traveling in search of... Ah!Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.66,0:23:52.02,Main,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.02,0:23:56.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Robin... do you know your mother's name?Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.90,0:23:57.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Olvia.Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.78,0:24:01.80,Main,,0,0,0,,It's Nico Olvia.Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.97,0:24:10.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Saul?!Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.34,0:24:14.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Robin is Olvia's daughter...!Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.26,0:24:19.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Then... could this place be... an island called Ohara?!Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.73,0:24:24.29,Main,,0,0,0,,– Yeah. – Ahh! This is terrible! Oh, no!Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.29,0:24:27.91,Main,,0,0,0,,So I drifted to Ohara?!Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.92,0:24:31.03,Main,,0,0,0,,This is no time to be sitting around talking!Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.03,0:24:32.81,Main,,0,0,0,,– Robin! – What is it?Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.81,0:24:36.91,Main,,0,0,0,,This might shock you, but listen to me carefully!Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.91,0:24:41.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Navy battleships should be headed to Ohara right now.Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.50,0:24:43.18,Main,,0,0,0,,The Navy? Why?Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.18,0:24:46.54,Main,,0,0,0,,In order to eliminate the scholars on this island!Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.94,0:24:49.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Eliminate them?Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.49,0:24:52.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't tell...Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.99,0:24:56.10,Main,,0,0,0,,– That's a lie... – Don't tell the Government you're a scholar!Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.10,0:24:58.38,Main,,0,0,0,,– That's a lie...! – Got that?!Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.38,0:25:00.09,Main,,0,0,0,,That's a lie!Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.09,0:25:03.56,Main,,0,0,0,,It's true! I'd never lie to you!Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.56,0:25:06.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Go to town now and see if anything strange has been happening!Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.77,0:25:10.18,Main,,0,0,0,,It's possible your mother might be back, too!Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.18,0:25:11.66,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.42,0:25:21.46,Captions,,0,0,0,,Nico Olvia ArchaeologistDialogue: 0,0:25:18.68,0:25:21.46,Main,,0,0,0,,It's been a while, everyone.Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.46,0:25:23.55,Main,,0,0,0,,– Olvia... – Olvia-san...!Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.55,0:25:25.75,Main,,0,0,0,,So it was you who came on that Navy ship!Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.75,0:25:27.91,Main,,0,0,0,,We thought you had been caught by the Navy...Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.62,0:25:38.07,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry that I came back bearing bad news.Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.07,0:25:40.34,Main,,0,0,0,,But what I just said is true.Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.34,0:25:44.52,Main,,0,0,0,,So the Government has finally set its sights on Ohara?Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.92,0:25:46.69,Main,,0,0,0,,Did you read the newspaper?Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.69,0:25:51.37,Main,,0,0,0,,The Poneglyph search team that set off from Ohara six years ago was annihilated.Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.37,0:25:56.21,Main,,0,0,0,,All of them except for me... A total of 33 members...Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.21,0:25:58.71,Main,,0,0,0,,I was also temporarily captured.Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.71,0:26:03.92,Main,,0,0,0,,The Government carefully analyzed my murdered companions’ belongings...Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.92,0:26:06.77,Main,,0,0,0,,and discovered that we came from Ohara.Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.76,0:26:13.09,Main,,0,0,0,,This is inexcusable! To think that this island is now in danger because of us!Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.09,0:26:16.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop it! It's no one's fault!Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.48,0:26:20.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Those who set out to sea and those who stayed here– we're all one team!Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.88,0:26:24.30,Main,,0,0,0,,You were the ones having a hard time.Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.90,0:26:27.06,Main,,0,0,0,,We put you through a terrible ordeal.Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.64,0:26:29.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Professor...Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.98,0:26:34.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Talented scholars from around the world...Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.31,0:26:37.23,Main,,0,0,0,,gather in Ohara to pursue history...Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.23,0:26:40.12,Main,,0,0,0,,and the Government has always considered us a threat.Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.12,0:26:43.47,Main,,0,0,0,,They must think they finally have something on us.Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.47,0:26:46.04,Main,,0,0,0,,They're not gonna pass up this opportunity.Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.04,0:26:50.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, but we found out before it was too late!Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.09,0:26:54.69,Main,,0,0,0,,Ultimately, they will eliminate all known scholars in Ohara!Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.69,0:26:58.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Everyone, we must escape Ohara immediately!Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.47,0:27:02.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah... this time, we probably won't be able to slip past their investigationDialogue: 0,0:27:02.63,0:27:05.45,Main,,0,0,0,,like we usually do...Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.45,0:27:09.53,Main,,0,0,0,,if they are trying to kill us.Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.53,0:27:10.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Then, hurry up and...Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.87,0:27:12.82,Main,,0,0,0,,But you know, Olvia...Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.82,0:27:17.43,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't run away leaving this treasure of mankind behind.Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.43,0:27:19.13,Main,,0,0,0,,You should know that.Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.13,0:27:22.00,Main,,0,0,0,,We feel the same way, Olvia.Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.00,0:27:23.91,Main,,0,0,0,,You guys...Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.91,0:27:26.67,Main,,0,0,0,,We don't know what the Government is up to.Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.67,0:27:30.42,Main,,0,0,0,,But if we run, the precious history that exists here won't be protected.Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.42,0:27:33.42,Main,,0,0,0,,We'll try whatever we can, just like we always have.Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.42,0:27:35.23,Main,,0,0,0,,More importantly...Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.23,0:27:38.15,Main,,0,0,0,,there must be something weighing on your mind.Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.15,0:27:41.40,Main,,0,0,0,,But I can't see her.Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.16,0:27:46.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Make up your mind, Olvia! Are you gonna come aboard the ship or not?Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.35,0:27:48.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Stay if you're gonna regret leaving your child!Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.96,0:27:51.94,Main,,0,0,0,,If it's about heartache for your husband, we will…Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.94,0:27:53.53,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,No! I'll come with you!Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.53,0:27:59.50,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I'm a scholar of Ohara. I can't abandon the will of our forebears!Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.20,0:28:01.50,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Robin.Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.50,0:28:05.43,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I'll be home after we solve all the mysteries!Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.09,0:28:15.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Mommy... Where's Mommy? Where did Mommy go?Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.98,0:28:21.19,Main,,0,0,0,,Your mother set out to sea for work. You'll stay here with us for a while.Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.19,0:28:23.77,Main,,0,0,0,,You're noisy! Be quiet or I'll hit you!Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.77,0:28:26.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, stop it. She's only two.Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.29,0:28:27.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Our daughter is two, too.Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.65,0:28:30.50,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't care whether she's your big sister's child or whatever–Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.50,0:28:33.68,Main,,0,0,0,,how dare you take in such a burden?!Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.25,0:28:37.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Wow...Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.00,0:28:39.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Who's there?! Don't move!Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.71,0:28:44.68,Main,,0,0,0,,U-Um... I... Um...Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.93,0:28:49.41,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.47,0:28:54.94,Main,,0,0,0,,When you wanna read books, just let me know.Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.94,0:28:57.89,Main,,0,0,0,,But I don't have money, so...Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.89,0:29:02.32,Main,,0,0,0,,You don't have to pay. You can read them all for free.Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.32,0:29:06.58,Main,,0,0,0,,– Free? – Yeah, since this is the best library in the world.Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.58,0:29:08.75,Main,,0,0,0,,– The best one in the world? – That's right.Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.75,0:29:11.87,Main,,0,0,0,,By the way, you're Olvia's daughter, right?Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.67,0:29:14.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Do you like books?Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.32,0:29:15.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah.Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.29,0:29:20.33,Main,,0,0,0,,She looks just like you did when you were a child.Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.33,0:29:23.25,Main,,0,0,0,,And like you were at that age, she's a rare genius, too.Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.27,0:29:27.25,Main,,0,0,0,,So long as I know she's okay...Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.92,0:29:31.39,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm too far down this path, so I must sever ties.Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.39,0:29:35.35,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't make her the daughter of a criminal.Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.35,0:29:39.07,Main,,0,0,0,,Professor Clover! This time, a ship flying the World Government's flag has come!Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.07,0:29:43.02,Main,,0,0,0,,A Government ship has come all the way to the West Blue...Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.02,0:29:46.99,Main,,0,0,0,,It indeed seems quite serious.Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.94,0:29:50.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Everyone, listen.Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.79,0:29:53.91,Main,,0,0,0,,You guys and I are neither fellow scholars nor acquaintances.Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.92,0:29:59.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Keep that in mind... no matter what happens!Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.62,0:30:02.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Wait, Olvia! What're you going to do?!Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.54,0:30:06.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, let the headquarters know that we arrived at our destination.Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.55,0:30:06.51,Captions,,0,0,0,,Ohara CoastlineDialogue: 0,0:30:06.51,0:30:09.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Now, go, go, go! Keep on moving!Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.51,0:30:12.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Geez... What a pain.Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.06,0:30:16.63,Main,,0,0,0,,In any case, this work'd better get me a promotion.Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.63,0:30:20.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, go get all the scholars and restrain them.Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.51,0:30:21.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.44,0:30:25.11,Main,,0,0,0,,– What's going on?! – A woman with a gun is running around!Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.84,0:30:49.05,Main,,0,0,0,,For heaven's sake! I'm sorry, Robin!Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.05,0:30:49.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Vice Admiral Kuzan!Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.10,0:30:54.46,Captions,,0,0,0,,West Blue Somewhere at SeaDialogue: 0,0:30:49.80,0:30:51.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Hm? What is it?Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.92,0:30:56.03,Main,,0,0,0,,We've been notified that CP9's Chief Spandine has arrived in Ohara.Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.03,0:31:01.93,Main,,0,0,0,,What? Is that something so important that you had to wake me up to tell me?!Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.96,0:31:03.42,Captions,,0,0,0,,Kuzan Vice Admiral, Navy Headquarters (Later to Become Admiral Aokiji)Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.93,0:31:03.42,Main,,0,0,0,,I-I'm sorry!Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.42,0:31:06.00,Credits,,0,0,0,,Editing: Galaxy 9000  Timing: Halee  Quality Assurance: Feeso, Galaxy 9000, Grug, Pepperjack  Soundtracking: Halee  Title & Infoboxes: Datenshi  Karaoke: KaitouYahiko  Translation: Crunchyroll, GaijinDialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.14,0:00:00.98,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,HDialogue: 2,0:00:00.17,0:00:00.98,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,aDialogue: 3,0:00:00.98,0:00:01.39,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,HaDialogue: 3,0:00:00.98,0:00:01.39,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,HaDialogue: 3,0:00:00.98,0:00:01.39,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,HaDialogue: 3,0:00:00.98,0:00:01.39,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,HaDialogue: 3,0:00:00.98,0:00:01.39,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,HaDialogue: 2,0:00:00.21,0:00:01.09,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,sDialogue: 2,0:00:00.24,0:00:01.09,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,hDialogue: 2,0:00:00.28,0:00:01.09,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,iDialogue: 3,0:00:01.09,0:00:01.87,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,shiDialogue: 3,0:00:01.09,0:00:01.87,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,shiDialogue: 3,0:00:01.09,0:00:01.87,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,shiDialogue: 3,0:00:01.09,0:00:01.87,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,shiDialogue: 3,0:00:01.09,0:00:01.87,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,shiDialogue: 2,0:00:00.31,0:00:01.57,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,rDialogue: 2,0:00:00.35,0:00:01.57,